---
description: Decide field-level findings for requestClearance.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Form a precise clearance request describing the actual use, audience, modifications, and duration. Track responses and conditions without treating informal enthusiasm as a license, and maintain restricted access to private donor or participant information. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
